+## ✅ THE SUITE IS GREEN (v11.53) — ONE ENVIRONMENTAL RED REMAINS
+
+`test_tapeking.js` fails in the CLOUD SANDBOX ONLY — `jsdom` cannot install there (npm 403). It passes on
+the user's machine. Everything else passes.
