+appended to the end of `test_em_band.js`, below the exit line, and the file reported the same 56 passes
+before and after the change. **Compare assertion COUNTS across a change, not just pass/fail.** It now
+reports 76.
+
+⚠ **`eval()` inside a `forEach` callback declares into the CALLBACK's scope.** Join and eval once. Already
+in the notes, and it cost time again during this very fix.
