+**`test_spx_levels.js` is RETIRED, not deleted** — `spxwLane`/`spxLevels` are gone from source; SPX levels
+come from `ifLadder` now. It carries a LIVE GUARD that FAILS if those functions ever return. Coverage sits
+in `test_if_ladder.js` / `test_levels_unified.js` / `test_spxw_confluence.js`.
+
+⚠ Never turn a suite green by deleting assertions. 23 stale failures once camouflaged two live bugs for
+months. A retirement WITH a stated reason and a guard is the opposite of that.
