+window slid the open walked forward: **7695.75 → 7713.71 in minutes (~18 pts)** while `em` sat still
+because it was captured. v11.59 pinned the SCALE (0.05 of drift) and v11.61 made that pin actually fire —
+**neither touched the real problem.**
+**The open is now CAPTURED (`openU`,`openSo`) and read from the record.** Self-heal is BACKWARD-ONLY: an
+earlier bar replaces the stored one, a later bar never can. Schema = 3.
+⚠ **Anything that must not move cannot be derived from `closedCandles()` at render time.**
+⚠ **A single snapshot of a live face is not evidence** — read it twice. Two elements looked broken in one
+check (regime `—`, piles 0) and both were mid-refresh frames; the real bug was the band bounds moving 16pts
+between reads.
