+### ✅ RESOLVED — THERE WAS NEVER A netGEX SIGN BUG
+**Verified to the decimal against their published all-expiry header:** ours call +263.83B / put −250.49B /
+net **+13.34B** / ratio 1.053 vs theirs +263.8B / −250.5B / **+13.3B** / 1.05. Our GEX is CORRECT.
