+`dte0 −6.86B · toFri −16.41B · all +13.34B` — near book negative, full chain positive, both true.
+Comparing across windows caused **two false alarms in one session** (the "sign bug", and "regime
+contradicts FLIP" — regime reads NEAR, FLIP is their ALL-EXPIRY zero gamma). **ALWAYS NAME THE WINDOW.**
+`GEX_WINDOW_LABEL` / `gexWindowNote()` exist for this; the FLIP hover says it outright.
