+`FEEDS $214M/pt` / `FIGHTS $214M/pt` from `hedgeFlow()` — NEAR book only (LEAPS do not hedge intraday).
+netGEX is per 1% move, so ÷(spot×0.01). Negative gamma → FEEDS (purple, accelerator); positive → FIGHTS
+(yellow, brake). Enrolled as `flow.perPoint`, **regime-split**, `hit:null` until n≥20.
